 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     MOVE "acceptance US14 a sweep needs full strength, no crit, no sprint knockback, the ground, slow horizontal movement (under 2.5 x the movement speed) and a sword" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I2
