     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I3
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I4
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I5
     CALL "TOOL-SWEEP-VICTIM" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-I5 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "1 0 0 0 0 0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 each swept entity is knocked back 0.4 along the attacker's yaw (sin yaw, -cos yaw)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I1
