     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     MOVE WS-O2 TO WS-E2
     MOVE WS-O3 TO WS-E3
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E3) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 90000 TO WS-I1
     CALL "TOOL-SWEEP-KNOCKBACK" USING WS-I1 WS-O1 WS-O2 WS-O3
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     MOVE WS-O2 TO WS-E2
     MOVE WS-O3 TO WS-E3
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E3) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "400/0/-1000 400/1000/0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     STOP RUN.

 ADD-OBS.
     IF TL-OBSERVED = SPACES
         MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-OBS) TO TL-OBSERVED
     ELSE
         STRING FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) " " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-OBS) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     END-IF.

 CHECK-DONE.
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT.
